{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 85,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        118.58090209960938,
        27.289522171020508,
        334.9440002441406,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "10. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE OXYGEN USE AND DELIVERY",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        250.73155212402344,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "—\t depressed mental state (drowsy, lethargic)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        75.14679718017578,
        252.91282653808594,
        89.0667953491211
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        91.41151428222656,
        399.0729675292969,
        104.9015121459961
      ],
      "text": "b)\tIn some situations and depending on the overall clinical condition, children with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        104.41151428222656,
        287.69146728515625,
        117.9015121459961
      ],
      "text": "the following less-specific signs may also need oxygen:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        117.41151428222656,
        218.01153564453125,
        130.90151977539062
      ],
      "text": "—\t severe lower chest wall indrawing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        130.41151428222656,
        222.9415740966797,
        143.90151977539062
      ],
      "text": "—\t respiratory rate of 70/min or above",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        143.41151428222656,
        138.22149658203125,
        156.90151977539062
      ],
      "text": "—\t head nodding",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        158.81610107421875,
        272.92279052734375,
        172.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        175.08070373535156,
        399.11273193359375,
        188.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "In view of the unreliability of the clinical signs in detecting hypoxaemia, the panel",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        188.08070373535156,
        399.08270263671875,
        201.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "strongly recommended that clinical signs should not be relied upon to detect",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        201.08070373535156,
        399.122802734375,
        214.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "hypoxaemia. Pulse oximetry is a non-invasive procedure and relatively inexpensive.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        214.08070373535156,
        399.00274658203125,
        227.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "It should be made globally available to ensure that it is part of the assessment of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        227.08070373535156,
        204.21290588378906,
        240.57070922851562
      ],
      "text": "hypoxaemia in seriously ill children.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        251.5992889404297,
        231.48292541503906,
        263.58929443359375
      ],
      "text": "10.2.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.2538757324219,
        399.0528259277344,
        280.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review of the clinical signs of hypoxaemia in children aged 2–59 months",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.28790283203125,
        280.03387451171875,
        391.6378479003906,
        293.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "see table A6.5",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.2538757324219,
        399.1164855957031,
        293.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "with pneumonia [Rigau, 2010] identified 11 diagnostic studies ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.2538757324219,
        396.80291748046875,
        306.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "Included studies differed in inclusion criteria (radiological pneumonia, WHO-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.2538757324219,
        399.03277587890625,
        319.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "defined pneumonia, or physician diagnosis), altitude (six studies at altitude > 1500",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.2538757324219,
        399.1227722167969,
        332.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "m above sea level), and the definition of hypoxaemia (ranging from < 93% at sea",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.2538757324219,
        399.0927429199219,
        345.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "level to < 85% at high altitudes). Three studies included neonates, while five did not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.2538757324219,
        399.1828918457031,
        358.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "stratify results by age. Most studies clearly described the clinical signs investigated,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        358.2538757324219,
        399.0428771972656,
        371.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "and all used pulse oximetry as the gold standard. The clinical signs investigated were,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        371.2538757324219,
        399.142822265625,
        384.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "in order of those most studied: tachypnoea, cyanosis, grunting, crepitations, chest",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        384.2538757324219,
        338.8028869628906,
        397.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "indrawing, difficulty feeding, nasal flaring, and altered mental status.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        397.2538757324219,
        399.0913391113281,
        410.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "Overall, all clinical signs tested had poor accuracy for predicting hypoxaemia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        410.2538757324219,
        399.11279296875,
        423.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "Most of the respiratory signs and symptoms have better specificity than sensitivity.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        423.25390625,
        399.1027526855469,
        436.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "However, signs with high specificity (i.e. cyanosis, grunting, difficulty feeding,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        436.25390625,
        399.10302734375,
        449.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "altered mental status), also had poor sensitivity, and vice versa. Cyanosis, nasal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        449.25390625,
        399.0729064941406,
        462.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "flaring, grunting, mental status, or difficulty in feeding are moderately specific signs.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        462.25390625,
        333.71295166015625,
        475.7439270019531
      ],
      "text": "Nasal flaring, chest indrawing, and crepitations were most sensitive.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        486.7724914550781,
        163.95286560058594,
        498.7624816894531
      ],
      "text": "10.2.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        502.42718505859375,
        244.85292053222656,
        515.9171752929688
      ],
      "text": "There were no data to assess benefits and risks.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        526.94580078125,
        205.31298828125,
        538.9358520507812
      ],
      "text": "10.2.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        542.6004028320312,
        399.1029052734375,
        556.0903930664062
      ],
      "text": "More data on how accurately health workers can detect these signs in daily clinical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        555.6004028320312,
        399.08282470703125,
        569.0903930664062
      ],
      "text": "practice are needed. Pulse oximetry is a much more accurate method of detecting",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        568.6004028320312,
        108.68290710449219,
        582.0903930664062
      ],
      "text": "hypoxaemia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.48260498046875,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.56460571289062,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "71",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}